# CODEOWNERS - GitHub Code Owners
#
# Rules follow gitignore pattern semantics. The LAST matching pattern wins.
#
# The repository owner is the only code owner, so a pull request the owner did not author
# requests the owner's review and nobody else's. GitHub never requests a review from a pull
# request's own author, so the owner's own pull requests request no one.
#
# Add narrower rules below if ownership splits in the future.

